---
import { page, asset } from '../utils/paths';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Modular Stands" active="modular-stands">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">

      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="hero-eyebrow">Modular Stands</span>

        <h1>Built To Fit. Made To <span>Impress</span></h1>

        <p>
          Flexible modular stands designed to adapt to your space and your brand.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href={page('contact/')} class="hero-btn">
            Get a Quote
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <picture>
          <source media="(min-width:992px)" srcset={asset('assets/images/7.lite-modular/hero.png')}>
          <img
            src={asset('assets/images/7.lite-modular/hero-mobile.png')}
            alt="Professional promotional lite modular stands">
        </picture>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="page-content">
    
    <section>
      <h2>Modular Stands</h2>
    
      <p>
        Modular exhibition stands offer the perfect balance
        between flexibility, practicality, and professional
        presentation. Designed to provide <strong>the appearance of a custom-built exhibition
        stand with the convenience of a simple self-build
        system</strong>, they are an ideal solution for
        businesses looking for adaptable and reusable
        display equipment.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Built around a straightforward panel and connector
        system, our modular stands are easy to assemble,
        dismantle, and reconfigure. Using simple donut-style
        joiners, individual panels can be connected to
        create a variety of layouts, allowing you to adapt
        your exhibition space to suit different venues,
        promotional activities, and presentation requirements.
      </p>
    
      <h3>Flexible by Design</h3>
    
      <p>
        One of the greatest advantages of modular exhibition
        systems is their versatility. Rather than investing
        in a completely new stand for every event, existing
        panels can be rearranged and reused to create
        different configurations. From compact promotional
        displays to larger exhibition environments, modular
        stands provide a practical solution that can evolve
        alongside your business.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        A range of compatible accessories and display
        options can also be incorporated to enhance
        functionality and presentation. These include
        stand-off graphic panels, integrated graphics,
        shelving, and workstations, helping you create
        an exhibition space that is both visually
        appealing and practical for engaging with visitors.
      </p>
    
      <h3>Key Features &amp; Benefits</h3>
    
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Simple self-build panel and connector system</li>
        <li>Quick and straightforward assembly and dismantling</li>
        <li>Flexible layouts for different exhibition spaces</li>
        <li>Reusable panels that can be reconfigured for future events</li>
        <li>Professional custom-built appearance</li>
        <li>Stand-off graphics and text display panels</li>
        <li>Integrated graphic display options</li>
        <li>Optional shelving for products and promotional materials</li>
        <li>Workstations and presentation areas</li>
        <li>Expandable configurations using compatible components</li>
      </ul>
    
      <p>
        Whether you're exhibiting at a small conference
        or creating a larger branded display, modular
        stands offer a reliable and cost-effective way
        to maintain a professional presence across
        multiple events.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="row text-center image-content">
      <div class="col-sm-6">
          <img src={asset('assets/images/7.lite-modular/image1.jpg')} alt="Portable modular exhibition stand setup at a conference" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-6">
          <img src={asset('assets/images/7.lite-modular/image2.jpg')} alt="Brand event display stand with promotional materials" />
        </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
